Het MP-gc-gpu-fence
"Heterogeneous MP-gc-gpu-fence: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA)"
{
1:X1=x;
1:X3=y;
}
 P0:gpu             | P1:cpu      ;
 w[relaxed,gpu] x 1 | LDR W0,[X3] ;
 f[sc,gpu]          | LDR W2,[X1] ;
 w[relaxed,gpu] y 1 |             ;
scopes: (sys (gpu (cta P0)))
exists (1:X0=1 /\ 1:X2=0)
